I'm running into a "Single file component can contain only one <script> element" error in Vue / Vite. I want to add a script tag that's required for all pages to get the universal CSS styling to work properly. I figured the only way to do that would be to add that script tag to the App.vue (the root Vue file), yet I can't because it already contains a script tag that exports it: <script>
