Sure! The LeetCode question 1011 is "Capacity To Ship Packages Within D Days". Below is a Java code that solves this problem using binary search:

```java
class Solution {
    public int shipWithinDays(int[] weights, int D) {
        int left = 0, right = 0;
        for (int weight : weights) {
            left = Math.max(left, weight);
            right += weight;
        }

        while (left < right) {
            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;
            int days = 1;
            int currWeight = 0;

            for (int weight : weights) {
                if (currWeight + weight > mid) {
                    days++;
                    currWeight = 0;
                }
                currWeight += weight;
            }

            if (days > D) {
                left = mid + 1;
            } else {
                right = mid;
            }
        }

        return left;
    }
}
```

