2. Create a new method to handle the rendering:

```java
@SubscribeEvent
public void onRenderGameOverlay(RenderGameOverlayEvent event) {
    if (event.getType() == RenderGameOverlayEvent.ElementType.TEXT) { // Only render in text overlay layer
        renderCube(event.getPartialTicks());
