To transfer data from one Google Sheet to another when the date entered in the first table is older than the current one, you can use Google Apps Script. Here's an example of how you can achieve this:

1. Open the Google Sheet from which you want to transfer data (let's call it "Source Sheet") and go to "Extensions" > "Apps Script" to open the Apps Script editor.
2. In the Apps Script editor, delete any existing code and replace it with the following code:

```javascript
function transferData() {
  var sourceSheet = SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSpreadsheet().getSheetByName('Sheet1'); // Replace 'Sheet1' with the name of your Source Sheet
  var destinationSheet = SpreadsheetApp.openById('DESTINATION_SHEET_ID').getSheetByName('Sheet1'); // Replace 'DESTINATION_SHEET_ID' with the ID of your destination Sheet and 'Sheet1' with the name of the destination Sheet

  var sourceData = sourceSheet.getDataRange().getValues();
  var today = new Date().setHours(0, 0, 0, 0); // Get today's date without the time

  for (var i = 0; i < sourceData.length; i++) {
    var dateEntered = new Date(sourceData[i][0]).setHours(0, 0, 0, 0); // Assuming the date is in the first column of the source sheet

    if (dateEntered < today) {
      destinationSheet.appendRow(sourceData[i]);
      sourceSheet.deleteRow(i + 1);
      i--; // Adjust the index as the row is deleted
    }
  }
}
```

3. Replace `'Sheet1'` with the name of the sheet in which the source data is present. Also, replace `'DESTINATION_SHEET_ID'` with the ID of the destination Google Sheet.
4. Save the script (`Ctrl + S` or `Cmd + S`) and close the Apps Script editor.
5. Back in the Source Sheet, refresh the page, and a new menu option "Transfer Data" should appear.
6. Now, whenever you want to transfer the data, click on the "Transfer Data" menu option and allow the necessary permissions.
7. The script will transfer rows with dates older than the current date to the destination sheet and remove them from the source sheet.

Note: Make sure to run the script manually whenever you want to transfer the data. It does not run automatically based on a trigger or the date in the sheet.

