- `!welcome setup`: This command sets up the welcome message channel in a guild. It will prompt the user to mention the channel where welcome messages will be sent. The channel will be saved in a database and can be retrieved later using the `!welcome channel` command.

- `!welcome channel`: This command allows the user to change the welcome message channel from the one previously set using `!welcome setup`. It will prompt the user to mention the channel they want to set as the welcome channel.

- `!welcome message <message>`: This command sets the custom welcome message that will be sent to the welcome channel.

- `!welcome remove`: This command removes the welcome message channel and custom message set in the guild.

